    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d416">

                <pb facs="0564" n="550" xml:id="pg550"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.3531/9–845: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Braden</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1945-09-08T21:00:00-03:00">September 8,
                            1945—9 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received 10:31 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>2114. Deptel 1228, September 7, 6 p.m. As stated over telephone to Brown,
                    entirely agree with Department’s recommendation and especially that Spain be
                    included with Argentina in group E specifically excluded for future purposes of
                    export control.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Braden</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
